    },
    {
      "id": "slovak_reading-2026-09-09-slovak-0030",
      "front": {
        "text": "Mama \u010dak\u00e1 na n\u00e1s.",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "Mom is waiting for us.",
        "notes": "[\u02c8t\u0361\u0283aka\u02d0]\n\n\u010dak\u00e1 is the third-person singular present form of \u010daka\u0165, meaning is waiting; \u010daka\u0165 na plus the accusative names the person or thing waited for."
      },
      "presentation": "text_reading",
      "available_at": "2026-09-11T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slovak_reading-2026-09-09-slovak-0032",
      "front": {
        "text": "Mami, tak dobre, u\u017e ideme.",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "Mom, all right then, we're going now.",
        "notes": "[tak \u02c8d\u0254br\u025b]\n\ntak dobre is a discourse phrase expressing agreement or acceptance, meaning all right then or OK then."
      },
      "presentation": "text_reading",
      "available_at": "2026-09-11T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slovak_reading-2026-09-10-slovak-0033",
      "front": {
        "text": "V tiskom jsem zdie\u013eal kufor s kolegom, ale on ho posielil do nov\u00e9ho mesta.",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "I shared my suitcase with a colleague, but he sent it to a new city.",
        "notes": "v tskim jsem zdie\u013eal kufor s kolegom, ale on ho posielil do nov\u00e9ho mesta.\n\nkufor is the accusative form of 'kufor' (suitcase), serving as the direct object of the verb 'zdie\u013eal' (shared)."
      },
      "presentation": "text_reading",
      "available_at": "2026-09-11T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slovak_reading-2026-09-11-slovak-0034",
      "front": {
        "text": "Nemohla som to poveda\u0165 tak dobre ako ty.",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "I couldn't say it as well as you.",
        "notes": "[tak \u02c8d\u0254br\u025b]\n\nPr\u00edslovcov\u00e9 spojenie \u201etak dobre\u201c znamen\u00e1 \u201etak ve\u013emi dobre\u201c; \u201etak\u201c zosil\u0148uje pr\u00edslovku \u201edobre\u201c."
      },
      "presentation": "text_reading",
      "available_at": "2026-09-11T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
